_pct":10.075}],"summary_long":"正達提供觸控感測與保護板玻璃、車載多曲面3D玻璃及Low-E建築節能玻璃；2025年智能光電占營收79.58%，為最大業務。年報具名揭露玻璃基板供應商包括AGC與康寧，媒體則確認其供應Apple產品的TrackPad。公司另與康寧合肥車載玻璃公司簽署策略合作備忘錄。正達取得越南SD Global全部股權，追加價款後總交易金額為1,100萬美元，並決議以25.8億元出售銅鑼土地建物予京元電子。新產品布局包括開發驗證中的HDD玻璃碟盤與FOPLP載板玻璃；無人機相關合作及部分投資則由全資子公司正達戰術科技執行。","summary_short":"以光電玻璃加工為主，提供觸控保護玻璃、車載曲面玻璃及建築節能玻璃。","tax_id":"97049373","themes":[{"also":[],"stage":"components","theme":"theme.ai_server","tier":"midstream"},{"also":[],"stage":"system","theme":"theme.drone","tier":"downstream"},{"also":[],"stage":"components","theme":"theme.apple","tier":"upstream"}],"top_customers":[{"as_of":"2026-03-09","confidence":"ai_cross_checked","counterparty_shares":[],"detail":"MacBook及iPad產品的TrackPad","details":["MacBook及iPad產品的TrackPad"],"edge":"e17725a8f0bf0","evidence_level":"media","id":"us.AAPL","name":"Apple","ranking_basis":"unranked","share_basis":null,"share_pct":null,"weight":1}],"top_suppliers":[{"as_of":"2026-04-03","confidence":"ai_cross_checked","counterparty_shares":[],"detail":"玻璃基板","details":["玻璃基板"],"edge":"eaf1ea0b65f43","evidence_level":"primary","id":"jp.5201","name":"AGC Inc.","ranking_basis":"unranked","share_basis":null,"share_pct":null,"weight":1},{"as_of":"2026-04-03","confidence":"ai_cross_checked","counterparty_shares":[],"detail":"玻璃基板","details":["玻璃基板"],"edge":"ea0ebd2f3e19c","evidence_level":"primary","id":"us.GLW","name":"康寧","ranking_basis":"unranked","share_basis":null,"share_pct":null,"weight":1}],"unresolved_mentions":["年報以代碼揭露的A供應商及B供應商，不能對應為AGC或康寧。","年報以代碼揭露的C、D、E客戶，不能直接對應為Apple或鴻海。","多家國際車廠及第一階供應商：未取得足以確定個別直接交易法人及買賣方向的證據。"],"website":"www.gtoc.com.tw"}